package rsdl.showcase

// RSDL-901 (rsdl reference §3.3): `Base` has tier `PLATFORM` and holds
// `Driver`, which requires `Horn`, offered by `Hooter` in `App`, which has tier
// `APPLICATION`.
// RSDL-905 (§3.3): `Chassis` is already in `Adas` (attributes.rsdl).
// RSDL-906 (§3.3): `Driver` is listed twice in `Base`.
distribution Base [ tier = PLATFORM ] { Driver, Chassis, Driver }

// RSDL-903 (§3.3): `Nothing` is not a closure component.
// RSDL-907 (§3.3): `Fleet` is external, and an external component is in no
// distribution.
distribution App [ tier = APPLICATION ] { Hooter, Nothing, Fleet }

// RSDL-904 (§3.3): `Rear` (resolution.rsdl) is in no distribution.

// An external component, listed by the system and placed on on-board machines
// as a stub (§9).
component Fleet [ external ] {}
